00:20:46.950 --> 00:20:49.003
until after that with him.

00:20:50.850 --> 00:20:54.650
I remember when he, we
were in the kitchen eating,

00:20:54.650 --> 00:20:58.040
and he told me that I was talking,

00:20:58.040 --> 00:21:00.310
or I was looking at somebody,

00:21:00.310 --> 00:21:02.270
and I didn't know what
he was talking about.

00:21:02.270 --> 00:21:03.220
I really didn't.

00:21:03.220 --> 00:21:04.053
I didn't know.

00:21:04.053 --> 00:21:06.220
I didn't know what he was talking about.

00:21:06.220 --> 00:21:08.790
And I got up and I left.

00:21:08.790 --> 00:21:10.060
Being me, I just didn't care.

00:21:10.060 --> 00:21:12.770
I didn't care, I wasn't gonna
argue with him, you know?

00:21:12.770 --> 00:21:14.820
So when he got back into the cell,

00:21:14.820 --> 00:21:16.623
he ripped my clothes off of me.

00:21:18.320 --> 00:21:19.247
He ripped my clothes off of me

00:21:19.247 --> 00:21:20.990
and he slapped me in the face.

00:21:20.990 --> 00:21:23.460
And then he told me that he
was gonna have, you know,

00:21:23.460 --> 00:21:25.610
all those black guys
that wanted to have me,

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.050
that he was gonna have them come in there,

00:21:27.050 --> 00:21:28.800
and he was gonna have them rape me.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:32.363
So I've been going
through this, like I said,

00:21:32.363 --> 00:21:34.010
throughout my whole life.

00:21:34.010 --> 00:21:36.320
It's been something that I just,

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:38.290
I bit down on it and
I just accepted things

00:21:38.290 --> 00:21:40.200
for the way they were.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:42.660
He wouldn't let me out of my cell.

00:21:42.660 --> 00:21:43.890
He wouldn't let me go nowhere.

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:46.013
And my uncles and my brother
didn't know what was going on

00:21:46.013 --> 00:21:48.113
because they were all across the yard.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.820
And they had just so happened to call me

00:21:52.820 --> 00:21:54.900
for a visit, an attorney visit.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:56.330
And he didn't want me to go.

00:21:56.330 --> 00:21:57.480
He wasn't gonna let me go.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.700
My clothes were ripped off.

00:21:58.700 --> 00:22:01.710
My face was black and blue on one side.

00:22:01.710 --> 00:22:04.013
And I promised him that
I was gonna come back

00:22:04.013 --> 00:22:06.720
and I wasn't gonna try to leave him.

00:22:06.720 --> 00:22:08.370
And I wasn't gonna do nothing about it.

00:22:08.370 --> 00:22:10.300
I was just gonna keep quiet.

00:22:10.300 --> 00:22:12.640
Well, as soon as I got out of that cell,

00:22:12.640 --> 00:22:14.800
I went straight to my case
manager, my counselor,

00:22:14.800 --> 00:22:16.570
and I told them to move me.

00:22:16.570 --> 00:22:18.087
I said, "I don't care where you move me.

00:22:18.087 --> 00:22:19.157
"I don't care if I go to the hole.

00:22:19.157 --> 00:22:20.457
"I don't care about anything anymore.

00:22:20.457 --> 00:22:21.937
"I want away from him.

00:22:21.937 --> 00:22:23.597
"I want out of this place."

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:28.060
So they told me that I
brought it upon myself

00:22:28.060 --> 00:22:29.920
because they warned me

00:22:29.920 --> 00:22:31.243
that I shouldn't have got in the cell

00:22:31.243 --> 00:22:32.600
with him in the beginning.

00:22:32.600 --> 00:22:34.227
And they were doing it

00:22:34.227 --> 00:22:36.290
for my own protection
when they put me in there

00:22:36.290 --> 00:22:37.770
because they knew that
it was gonna happen.

00:22:37.770 --> 00:22:40.230
Something like that was gonna happen.

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:42.130
But I didn't find that it was my fault.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:43.600
I didn't ask for him to do that.

00:22:43.600 --> 00:22:45.900
I didn't ask for any of that.

00:22:45.900 --> 00:22:46.980
So they did move him.

00:22:46.980 --> 00:22:48.280
When they called him to move,

00:22:48.280 --> 00:22:49.910
by the time I got back to the building

00:22:49.910 --> 00:22:52.010
and they were moving him,

00:22:52.010 --> 00:22:55.120
the officer told me to stay out of my cell

00:22:55.120 --> 00:22:57.180
and let them get him out of there.

00:22:57.180 --> 00:22:59.577
And he kept on telling me,
"I know you did this Angel.

00:22:59.577 --> 00:23:00.410
"I know you did this."

00:23:00.410 --> 00:23:01.930
I said, "What did I do?"

00:23:01.930 --> 00:23:03.680
He said, "I know you had me moved."

00:23:03.680 --> 00:23:05.677
I said, "I'm not gonna
argue with you, it's over.

00:23:05.677 --> 00:23:07.577
"I don't want nothing to do with you."

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:12.500
He was going to get into
a physical altercation

00:23:12.500 --> 00:23:13.333
with the staff,

00:23:13.333 --> 00:23:15.720
but he, I guess he's had
second thoughts about it,

00:23:15.720 --> 00:23:18.720
figuring that he wasn't
gonna get nowhere with that.

00:23:18.720 --> 00:23:21.253
So he went ahead and he moved his stuff.

00:23:22.520 --> 00:23:24.380
I didn't go out to eat to the kitchen

00:23:24.380 --> 00:23:26.220
for about a week and a half, two weeks.

00:23:26.220 --> 00:23:28.470
I stood in the building
and I wouldn't leave.

00:23:30.150 --> 00:23:32.070
My brother and them came
over there to see me,

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:33.067
and they asked me what happened.

00:23:33.067 --> 00:23:35.090
And I had told them some of it,

00:23:35.090 --> 00:23:35.963
but I didn't tell them all of it

00:23:35.963 --> 00:23:37.630
because I didn't want it to blow up

00:23:37.630 --> 00:23:38.740
to be something more.

00:23:38.740 --> 00:23:40.320
Because he was Cuban,

00:23:40.320 --> 00:23:42.370
and like I said, my
uncles are all, you know,

00:23:42.370 --> 00:23:43.203
they're all gangsters.

00:23:43.203 --> 00:23:44.940
They're all from the Harbor area.

00:23:44.940 --> 00:23:47.450
And they had told him don't
ever do nothing to me.

00:23:47.450 --> 00:23:48.390
Don't let them here,

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:51.420
or, you know, he was gonna
pay the consequences.

00:23:51.420 --> 00:23:53.740
So I didn't tell him
everything that he did.

00:23:53.740 --> 00:23:57.270
What, Nana, what? (speaks Spanish)

00:23:57.270 --> 00:23:59.620
And I just, you know, I
dealt with it day by day,

00:23:59.620 --> 00:24:01.540
but I wouldn't come out
because I was scared

00:24:01.540 --> 00:24:03.930
that I, I didn't know
what he was gonna do.

00:24:03.930 --> 00:24:05.280
I didn't, I wasn't positive.

00:24:05.280 --> 00:24:06.640
For him to do that, you know,

00:24:06.640 --> 00:24:07.473
to rip my clothes off of me

00:24:07.473 --> 00:24:10.240
and threaten me with
the things that he did.

00:24:10.240 --> 00:24:15.240
And I felt that if I
did say anything else,

00:24:15.660 --> 00:24:16.770
I was either gonna end up

00:24:16.770 --> 00:24:17.830
in the hole permanently,

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:19.080
where they don't let me out.

00:24:19.080 --> 00:24:21.370
And I had years to do still.

00:24:21.370 --> 00:24:22.910
Or I was gonna turn around

00:24:22.910 --> 00:24:26.200
and, you know, just
let him just step on me

00:24:26.200 --> 00:24:28.680
like a doormat, one of the two.

00:24:28.680 --> 00:24:30.950
But I did not come out of
that building, like I said,

00:24:30.950 --> 00:24:32.230
until he came one day

00:24:32.230 --> 00:24:35.160
and he promised that he wasn't
ever gonna do that again.

00:24:35.160 --> 00:24:37.230
And like I said, he was
my first relationship.

00:24:37.230 --> 00:24:39.490
So I was torn between
feelings at that time.

00:24:39.490 --> 00:24:42.080
But I was scared of him.

00:24:42.080 --> 00:24:42.913
I was young.

00:24:42.913 --> 00:24:43.746
I was scared of him.

00:24:46.210 --> 00:24:47.630
I took him back.

00:24:47.630 --> 00:24:49.690
They moved me to the
building that he was in,

00:24:49.690 --> 00:24:51.693
but my uncle was also in that building.

00:24:52.620 --> 00:24:54.280
All I remember is I drank one day,

00:24:54.280 --> 00:24:57.760
they made this homemade wine, pruno.

00:24:57.760 --> 00:24:59.083
And I guess, you know,

00:25:00.280 --> 00:25:02.950
I must've just tilted it back
and drank the whole thing.

00:25:02.950 --> 00:25:04.880
And just everything came
out of me at one time.

00:25:04.880 --> 00:25:06.550
Me and him got into an altercation.

00:25:06.550 --> 00:25:09.560
My uncle and him got into an altercation.

00:25:09.560 --> 00:25:11.552
My uncle ended up going to the hole

00:25:11.552 --> 00:25:16.552
for assaulting the, it was
either the captain or somebody,

00:25:22.450 --> 00:25:23.350
but they took him.

00:25:26.330 --> 00:25:28.050
When I woke up in the morning,

00:25:28.050 --> 00:25:30.210
I didn't remember any
of that that happened

00:25:30.210 --> 00:25:32.540
after I, I guess I just,
you know, blacked out.

00:25:32.540 --> 00:25:33.713
I had a blackout.

00:25:34.675 --> 00:25:39.675
I had abrasions above my eyebrow.

00:25:40.560 --> 00:25:42.253
I had some on my lower lip.

00:25:44.800 --> 00:25:46.793
Maybe a half hour after I woke up,

00:25:48.210 --> 00:25:49.910
six police came in there,

00:25:49.910 --> 00:25:53.593
and they told me to pack my stuff up.

00:25:55.310 --> 00:25:56.680
I just got off the bed like nothing.

00:25:56.680 --> 00:25:57.590
And I said, "Okay."

00:25:57.590 --> 00:25:58.723
I didn't ask where I was going.

00:25:58.723 --> 00:26:00.660
I didn't ask what I did.

00:26:00.660 --> 00:26:02.793
I was kind of happy that I was leaving.

00:26:03.790 --> 00:26:04.960
Wherever, it would have been better.

00:26:04.960 --> 00:26:05.960
I didn't care where.

00:26:06.880 --> 00:26:09.370
And he woke up like the devil

00:26:09.370 --> 00:26:10.827
and he said, "She's not going nowhere.

00:26:10.827 --> 00:26:12.610
"She's not going nowhere."

00:26:12.610 --> 00:26:13.877
And they said, "Sit where you're at.

00:26:13.877 --> 00:26:14.710
"Don't move.

00:26:14.710 --> 00:26:15.543
"Don't move from there.

00:26:15.543 --> 00:26:17.557
"Sit where you're at, we're
gonna have to detain you.

00:26:17.557 --> 00:26:18.967
"Let her get her stuff."

00:26:19.830 --> 00:26:22.850
They got all my stuff together

00:26:22.850 --> 00:26:24.510
and they put me on a bus,

00:26:24.510 --> 00:26:26.833
and I ended up in another prison.

00:26:27.840 --> 00:26:29.050
They transferred me out.

00:26:29.050 --> 00:26:30.950
But on the way out that I was leaving,

00:26:34.270 --> 00:26:35.660
on the way out that I was leaving,

00:26:35.660 --> 00:26:37.353
he had cut his wrist.

00:26:38.950 --> 00:26:39.970
He had cut his wrist,

00:26:39.970 --> 00:26:44.970
and, you know, it kinda made me not doubt

00:26:45.370 --> 00:26:46.210
what I was feeling

00:26:46.210 --> 00:26:47.700
or what I was going through.

00:26:47.700 --> 00:26:49.150
But it made me confused,

00:26:49.150 --> 00:26:50.960
because for him to do that to himself

00:26:50.960 --> 00:26:52.360
because they were taking me,

00:26:53.450 --> 00:26:55.830
it put me, you know, in a
different spot, you know,

00:26:55.830 --> 00:26:57.200
from what I was thinking about him,

00:26:57.200 --> 00:26:59.847
because now I'm thinking,
"Well, maybe he cares.

00:26:59.847 --> 00:27:00.797
"But no, how do you care about somebody

00:27:00.797 --> 00:27:02.497
"and then you try to hurt them

00:27:02.497 --> 00:27:04.748
"and you want all these
people to rape this person?

00:27:04.748 --> 00:27:06.867
"How can you care about this person?"

00:27:07.760 --> 00:27:10.020
So I ended up in another prison

00:27:10.880 --> 00:27:13.470
where I had a problem there too.

00:27:13.470 --> 00:27:15.330
I had that opportunity to go

00:27:15.330 --> 00:27:16.770
into an all-female dorm

00:27:16.770 --> 00:27:18.403
or I can live with the males.

00:27:19.970 --> 00:27:21.470
I stood living with the males.

00:27:21.470 --> 00:27:22.780
I didn't want to go with the females.

00:27:22.780 --> 00:27:24.440
I didn't want to go with the women.

00:27:24.440 --> 00:27:26.090
Because that was another problem.

00:27:27.310 --> 00:27:29.910
So when I got there,

00:27:29.910 --> 00:27:31.220
I think I was on their yard

00:27:31.220 --> 00:27:35.440
for maybe three weeks to a month?

00:27:35.440 --> 00:27:36.280
Three weeks to a month.

00:27:36.280 --> 00:27:38.720
And sure enough, the
problems came, back to back.

00:27:38.720 --> 00:27:40.070
It was one thing after another,

00:27:40.070 --> 00:27:41.310
not with the guys this time.

00:27:41.310 --> 00:27:43.210
It was with the women that were there.

00:27:44.590 --> 00:27:46.550
And I just, I guess I just snapped.

00:27:46.550 --> 00:27:51.550
I got to the point where I got
tired of defending, you know,

00:27:52.450 --> 00:27:56.240
who I am, you know,
why do the things I do,

00:27:56.240 --> 00:27:59.070
or, you know, explaining
anything about my life, period.

00:27:59.070 --> 00:28:01.880
I got to that point where
I just didn't care no more.

00:28:01.880 --> 00:28:05.090
So I went back to my,
I went back to my room.

00:28:05.090 --> 00:28:06.280
I got a blade

00:28:07.350 --> 00:28:09.345
and I put it in the inside of my mouth.

00:28:09.345 --> 00:28:10.840
And when I went outside,

00:28:10.840 --> 00:28:12.570
I went to the person that was harassing me

00:28:12.570 --> 00:28:15.940
and I walked up to that person

00:28:15.940 --> 00:28:17.330
and I cut her in her face.

00:28:17.330 --> 00:28:19.313
I gave her a cut from here to here.

00:28:20.360 --> 00:28:22.430
And then I looked at her
and she said, "Put it down."

00:28:22.430 --> 00:28:23.300
I said, "I could have did that.

00:28:23.300 --> 00:28:25.617
"I could of whipped your
ass without this razor,

00:28:25.617 --> 00:28:26.837
"but I want you to remember me.

00:28:26.837 --> 00:28:30.040
"I want you to remember everything
that you put me through."

00:28:30.040 --> 00:28:30.990
So I left.

00:28:30.990 --> 00:28:32.210
I just walked off like nothing,

00:28:32.210 --> 00:28:33.430
but as fast as I could,

00:28:33.430 --> 00:28:34.590
and I went back to my room,

00:28:34.590 --> 00:28:36.810
and I disposed of the
razor inside the toilet.

00:28:36.810 --> 00:28:37.743
I flushed it.

00:28:38.930 --> 00:28:41.090
Maybe five minutes, ten
minutes at the most,

00:28:41.090 --> 00:28:42.210
I was sitting on the yard

00:28:42.210 --> 00:28:45.300
watching everything as it unfolded.

00:28:45.300 --> 00:28:46.350
They brought her first.

00:28:46.350 --> 00:28:49.010
All her kitchen whites were all bloody.

00:28:49.010 --> 00:28:50.590
Then they turned around and they came,

00:28:50.590 --> 00:28:52.350
and they told me to stand up

00:28:52.350 --> 00:28:54.827
and put my hands behind my back.

00:28:54.827 --> 00:28:56.680
And I asked him for what.

00:28:56.680 --> 00:28:58.660
I questioned it, even
though I knew what I did.

00:28:58.660 --> 00:28:59.593
I questioned it.

00:29:00.480 --> 00:29:04.217
And they said, "You're going
to the hole for investigation."

00:29:05.200 --> 00:29:06.430
I said, "For what?"

00:29:06.430 --> 00:29:08.000
They said, "You know what you did."

00:29:08.000 --> 00:29:09.800
They took me to the hole.

00:29:09.800 --> 00:29:11.010
They took the cuffs off of me

00:29:11.010 --> 00:29:12.230
after they put me in the cell,

00:29:12.230 --> 00:29:13.373
but when they took the cuffs off of me,

00:29:13.373 --> 00:29:14.790
I guess they noticed the blood

00:29:14.790 --> 00:29:16.180
that was splattered on my hand.

00:29:16.180 --> 00:29:18.630
And I didn't even know it was there.

00:29:18.630 --> 00:29:19.720
But he took the cuffs off.

00:29:19.720 --> 00:29:20.907
He walked away as fast as he could.

00:29:20.907 --> 00:29:22.930
And I guess, you know, he figured

00:29:22.930 --> 00:29:24.730
if he says something,

00:29:24.730 --> 00:29:26.320
it's gonna mess up their evidence,

00:29:26.320 --> 00:29:27.153
which it would have.

00:29:27.153 --> 00:29:29.630
I didn't notice until
after I did like this,

00:29:29.630 --> 00:29:30.580
and I seen it and I heard it

00:29:30.580 --> 00:29:32.460
from washing my hands in the sink.

00:29:32.460 --> 00:29:34.077
So when he came back, he said,

00:29:34.077 --> 00:29:35.207
"Why did you wash your hands?

00:29:35.207 --> 00:29:36.420
"I seen that blood on your hands."

00:29:36.420 --> 00:29:38.000
I said, "What are you talking about?"

00:29:38.000 --> 00:29:39.470
I denied it.

00:29:39.470 --> 00:29:44.470
I sat in that hole for nine months, I did,

00:29:44.740 --> 00:29:45.880
in that hole by myself,

00:29:45.880 --> 00:29:47.243
in the cell by myself.

00:29:48.550 --> 00:29:51.260
And I started, you
know, getting mad again.

00:29:51.260 --> 00:29:53.330
You know, I had anger problems

00:29:53.330 --> 00:29:55.620
because of everything
that I've been through.

00:29:55.620 --> 00:29:59.580
So I'd blow up after a
certain period of time.

00:29:59.580 --> 00:30:00.413
It would just, I hold everything in,

00:30:00.413 --> 00:30:02.190
and then all of a sudden, you know,

00:30:02.190 --> 00:30:05.860
just whatever was going
on that affected me,

00:30:05.860 --> 00:30:07.830
I let everything out.

00:30:07.830 --> 00:30:09.740
So that's what I started doing again.

00:30:09.740 --> 00:30:11.260
And then they wanted to get rid of me,

00:30:11.260 --> 00:30:12.320
but they didn't know what to do,

00:30:12.320 --> 00:30:14.820
because my case was pending still.

00:30:14.820 --> 00:30:17.090
It was pending because they
wanted to give me another case

00:30:17.090 --> 00:30:18.290
for cutting that person.

00:30:19.740 --> 00:30:21.600
But they couldn't, they
didn't have no evidence,

00:30:21.600 --> 00:30:22.890
no evidence at all.

00:30:22.890 --> 00:30:24.240
So they finally turned around

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:28.460
and they sent me to Colorado.

00:30:28.460 --> 00:30:30.560
The coldest place they
could figure to send me.

00:30:30.560 --> 00:30:32.560
I went, I went wherever they sent me.

00:30:32.560 --> 00:30:33.500
I went to the hole there

00:30:33.500 --> 00:30:34.853
as soon as I got there too.

00:30:36.370 --> 00:30:37.600
They came and they interviewed me.

00:30:37.600 --> 00:30:39.060
They let me out of the hole there.

00:30:39.060 --> 00:30:40.993
And as soon as I got into the dorm,

00:30:42.420 --> 00:30:43.430
again, like I said,

00:30:43.430 --> 00:30:45.520
I, you know, prostitution
wasn't new to me,

00:30:45.520 --> 00:30:46.870
so I did what I had to do.

00:30:46.870 --> 00:30:49.480
I didn't have nobody taking
care of me on the streets,

00:30:49.480 --> 00:30:50.330
just like now.

00:30:50.330 --> 00:30:51.163
I have three people.

00:30:51.163 --> 00:30:52.600
She's the baby out of all of them.

00:30:52.600 --> 00:30:53.660
I have two bigger ones.

00:30:53.660 --> 00:30:56.510
The girl's two years old
and the boy's a year.

00:30:56.510 --> 00:30:57.583
And they're terrible,

